# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE KEYS — never commit these.
#
# secrets.dart holds the Gemini API key. A key found in a public repository can
# be used by anyone, and the usage is charged to the account it belongs to.
# There are bots that scan new GitHub commits for keys within minutes.
#
# secrets_template.dart IS committed on purpose, so anyone who clones the
# project knows what to create and can paste their own free key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
lib/secrets.dart
